        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset BL, Balboa Wave Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Kwikset made Balboa Lever will look great in almost any home; and since it is available in four functions to choose from, you will be sure to find exactly what you're looking for. This leverset will fit 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". The unique wave design will add a sense of movement to any space.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Balboa Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-driled doors.</li>\r\n<li>5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed lever.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Dual torque springs.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel strike.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Classic Kwikset Balboa Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection Keyed Entry: 2-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection for Keyed Entry Function: 2-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive lever for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational lever is for one side of the door. Visible installation screws on this function. Complete Set - 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior lever engages privacy lock on both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior lever. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 3 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Half Dummy Levers are Handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other Balboa Lever functions are non-handed.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-SH243-specifications.gif?v=1704354750\" width=\"572\" height=\"66\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Kwikset BL Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Balboa Door Lever Set, Kwikset BL",
                "description": "Kwikset BL Balboa Leverset - This Kwikset made Balboa Lever will look great in almost any home; and since it is available in four functions to choose from, you will be sure to find exactly what you're looking for. This leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The unique wave design will add a sense of movement to any space.",
                "keywords": "KWI-BL, Kwikset Balboa Door Lever Sets,  kwikset security series, kwi-488BL half dummy levers, kwi-200BL passage levers, kwi-300BL privacy levers, kwi-405BL keyed entry levers, residential door lever sets, Balboa Lever sets, wave leversets, ornate levers, traditional levers, old world door hardware,"
